    {
      "text": "At twenty-three Yun Luo Tian had reached rank three peak stage; at thirty-five he is a step away from rank four peak stage.",
      "chapters": [
        375
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-entrance-and-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yun_luo_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At an inheritance entrance on San Cha Mountain, Yun Luo Tian wears white clothing when he blocks Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing as a righteous Gu Master, then enters after Fang Yuan yields the queue. Nearby talk treats Yun clan as first-class rather than a super clan. His conduct is inspected as representing Yun clan’s image, and he expects the exchange to raise Yun clan’s standing in the righteous faction.",
      "chapters": [
        376
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-entrance-and-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
