      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inside-the-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the inheritance he meets Bai Ning Bing again and dies when her dog beasts overwhelm him.",
      "chapters": [
        381
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inside-the-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before dying he warns that killing him would offend Yun clan; Bai Ning Bing answers that she does not fear that house. As young clan leader he carries two tokens meant to protect him, but both fail when he tries to leave.",
      "chapters": [
        382
      ],
